        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="54" value="Node control ports&#xa;443 / 10250 / 9443 from control plane only" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#fb923c;fontColor=#7c2d12;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" parent="21" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1665" y="630" width="250" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="55" value="최종 발표 포인트" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=18;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#0f172a;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" parent="21" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1490" y="770" width="390" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="56" value="1. 인터넷 공개는 ALB 80/443만 허용&#xa;2. 앱은 source SG chaining으로만 내부 접근&#xa;3. DB/Kafka/Redis/ES는 필요한 소스만 허용&#xa;4. Bastion / EKS API는 현재 발표 PC /32로 제한&#xa;5. 관측용 내부 NLB도 9090 / 3100만 유지&#xa;6. 예전 shared backend SG는 제거" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=14;spacing=10;" parent="55" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="24" y="56" width="342" height="168" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
